KvaserUSB C ABI header
--------------------
Source: https://github.com/cliffrubio/macOS-CAN-Drivers
Commit: d2d06333ce988916c971c25d4707afb25fde76ae, KvaserUSB/include/KvaserUSB.h
Copyright 2017-2023 Kvaser AB, Mölndal, Sweden; Copyright 2026 Cliff Rubio.
Upstream offers BSD-3-Clause OR GPL-2.0-only. CANHarbor selects BSD-3-Clause.
The unchanged header and full upstream license, including the BSD conditions
and disclaimer, are retained in third-party/macOS-CAN-Drivers/KvaserUSB/.
The Rust ABI declarations in canharbor-kvaser/src/ffi.rs are adapted under
BSD-3-Clause. Original CANHarbor adapter code is AGPL-3.0-or-later.
No native driver binary is included. Users install a trusted compatible
open-source libKvaserUSB separately. Provenance: docs/kvaser-provenance.json.

